{"url": "https://wiki.idlecorp.xyz/api.php?format=json&formatversion=2&action=parse&page=Orbit&prop=text%7Clinks%7Cimages%7Ctemplates%7Ccategories&redirects=1", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-09T14:55:19.267457+00:00", "body": "{\"parse\":{\"title\":\"Orbit\",\"pageid\":265,\"redirects\":[],\"text\":\"<div class=\\\"mw-parser-output\\\"><p>Orbit can be showed by using <code>$$orbit</code>. It shows the status of <a href=\\\"/index.php/Space_station\\\" title=\\\"Space station\\\">space station</a> and the active <a href=\\\"/index.php/Relic\\\" title=\\\"Relic\\\">relics</a> in the <a href=\\\"/index.php/Quantum_vault\\\" title=\\\"Quantum vault\\\">quantum vault</a>.\\n</p>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Space_station\\\">Space station</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Orbit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Space station\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<p>When you have not built a <a href=\\\"/index.php/Space_station\\\" title=\\\"Space station\\\">space station</a>, it shows \\\"<i>Not built</i>\\\".\\n</p><p>If you have the space station, it shows your space station level, Expedition Points that your got from <a href=\\\"/index.php/Galactic_Expedition\\\" title=\\\"Galactic Expedition\\\">Galactic Expedition</a> and the damage your space station received.\\n</p>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Quantum_Vault\\\">Quantum Vault</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Orbit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Quantum Vault\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<p>When you have not any active <a href=\\\"/index.php/Relic\\\" title=\\\"Relic\\\">relics</a> in the <a href=\\\"/index.php/Quantum_vault\\\" title=\\\"Quantum vault\\\">quantum vault</a>, it shows \\\"<i>No active relics</i>\\\"\\n</p>\\n<!-- \\nNewPP limit report\\nCached time: 20261008211832\\nCache expiry: 86400\\nDynamic content: false\\nComplications: []\\nCPU time usage: 0.000 seconds\\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\\nPreprocessor visited node count: 11/1000000\\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\\nHighest expansion depth: 2/40\\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\\n-->\\n<!--\\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key icwiki:pcache:idhash:265-0!canonical and timestamp 20261008211832 and revision id 1662\\n -->\\n</div>\",\"categories\":[],\"links\":[{\"ns\":0,\"title\":\"Galactic Expedition\",\"exists\":true},{\"ns\":0,\"title\":\"Quantum vault\",\"exists\":true},{\"ns\":0,\"title\":\"Relic\",\"exists\":true},{\"ns\":0,\"title\":\"Space station\",\"exists\":true}],\"templates\":[],\"images\":[]}}"}